#. Label of the booking button
#: catalogue:booking.button.book
msgid "Book course (1 credit)"
msgstr "Kurs buchen (1 Credit)"

#. Label shown when the session is booked
#: catalogue:booking.button.cancel
msgid "Cancel booking"
msgstr "Buchung stornieren"

#. Short label in the booking list
#: catalogue:booking.button.cancel_short
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Stornieren"

#. Note for visitors who are not logged in
#: catalogue:booking.note.login
msgid "Please log in to book."
msgstr "Bitte einloggen um zu buchen."

#. The session is in the past
#: catalogue:booking.note.past
msgid "This session is over."
msgstr "Dieser Termin ist vorbei."

#. Too close to the start — booking has closed
#: catalogue:booking.note.closed
msgid "Booking for this session has closed."
msgstr "Die Buchung für diesen Termin ist geschlossen."

#: includes/settings.php:159
msgid "Booking closes (minutes before start)"
msgstr "Buchung möglich bis (Minuten vor Beginn)"

#: includes/settings.php:252
msgid "How many minutes before the session start customers can still book. 0 = until the session starts. Bookings by the admin are not affected."
msgstr "Bis wie viele Minuten vor Kursbeginn Kunden noch buchen können. 0 = bis zum Beginn. Buchungen durch die Admin sind nicht betroffen."

#. No spots left
#: catalogue:booking.note.full
msgid "This session is fully booked."
msgstr "Dieser Termin ist ausgebucht."

#. Booked, but the cancellation deadline has passed
#: catalogue:booking.note.booked
msgid "You are booked for this session."
msgstr "Du bist für diesen Termin angemeldet."

#. Credit balance used up, shown before the top-up link — also fits customers with no prior booking
#: catalogue:booking.note.no_credits
msgid "You have no credits."
msgstr "Du hast keine Credits."

#. Label of the link to the shop page
#: catalogue:booking.link.topup
msgid "Top up now"
msgstr "Jetzt aufladen"

#. Label of the add-to-cart button of a credit product (it leads straight to the checkout)
#: catalogue:cart.credit_button
msgid "Buy now"
msgstr "Jetzt kaufen"

#. Notice at the checkout when another item was in the cart
#: catalogue:cart.credit_replaced
msgid "Your cart was replaced by the selected credit package."
msgstr "Dein Warenkorb wurde durch das gewählte Guthaben-Paket ersetzt."

#. Error when a credit product and another product would be in one cart
#: catalogue:cart.credit_only
msgid "A credit package can only be ordered on its own. Please complete this order first or empty your cart."
msgstr "Ein Guthaben-Paket kann nur einzeln bestellt werden. Bitte schließe zuerst diese Bestellung ab oder leere deinen Warenkorb."

#. Text-Katalog group heading
#: catalogue:GROUPS.newsletter
msgid "Newsletter Opt-in"
msgstr "Newsletter-Anmeldung"

#. Checkbox at the registration
#: catalogue:newsletter.optin_label
msgid "Yes, I would like to receive the newsletter once a week and get the Beginner Special once for €40 instead of €45. I will get a confirmation email first and can unsubscribe at any time."
msgstr "Ja, ich möchte den Newsletter einmal pro Woche erhalten und bekomme das Einsteiger-Special einmalig für 40 € statt 45 €. Ich erhalte zuerst eine Bestätigungs-E-Mail und kann mich jederzeit abmelden."

#. Link label next to the newsletter checkbox
#: catalogue:newsletter.optin_privacy
msgid "Privacy Policy"
msgstr "Datenschutzerklärung"

#: includes/settings.php:171
msgid "Newsletter opt-in"
msgstr "Newsletter-Anmeldung"

#: includes/settings.php:172
msgid "Optional checkbox at the account registration and the checkout. Ticking it starts the double opt-in of the Brevo newsletter form (form 4 for German, form 5 for all other languages)."
msgstr "Optionale Checkbox bei der Kontoregistrierung und an der Kasse. Mit dem Häkchen startet das Double-Opt-in des Brevo-Newsletter-Formulars (Formular 4 für Deutsch, Formular 5 für alle anderen Sprachen)."

#: includes/settings.php:175
msgid "Newsletter checkbox"
msgstr "Newsletter-Checkbox"

#: includes/settings.php:307
msgid "Show the newsletter checkbox at the registration and the checkout"
msgstr "Newsletter-Checkbox bei der Registrierung und an der Kasse anzeigen"

#: includes/settings.php:309
msgid "Off by default. The wording can be changed under Newsletter Opt-in in the text settings."
msgstr "Standardmäßig aus. Der Wortlaut lässt sich in den Texteinstellungen unter „Newsletter-Anmeldung“ ändern."

#. Notice in the cart and at the checkout while another credit product is in the cart
#: catalogue:newsletter.swap_notice
msgid "New here? Sign up for the newsletter and get the Beginner Special (3 credits, valid for 90 days) once for €40 instead of €45."
msgstr "Neu bei uns? Melde dich für den Newsletter an und erhalte das Einsteiger-Special (3 Credits, 90 Tage gültig) einmalig für 40 € statt 45 €."

#. Button of that notice (replaces the credit product in the cart)
#: catalogue:newsletter.swap_button
msgid "Switch to the Beginner Special"
msgstr "Zum Einsteiger-Special wechseln"

#. Line under the price of the Beginner Special
#: catalogue:newsletter.product_hint
msgid "With a newsletter sign-up you pay only €40 instead of €45 – once per person."
msgstr "Mit Newsletter-Anmeldung zahlst du nur 40 € statt 45 € – einmalig pro Person."

#. Link label of that line
#: catalogue:newsletter.product_link
msgid "Sign up for the newsletter"
msgstr "Zum Newsletter anmelden"

#: includes/settings.php:176
msgid "Beginner Special (product ID)"
msgstr "Einsteiger-Special (Produkt-ID)"

#: includes/settings.php:177
msgid "Discount code"
msgstr "Rabattcode"

#: includes/settings.php:314
msgid "The product the newsletter offer is about (in the default language; translations are found automatically). The cart and checkout notices, the product page line and the automatic discount refer to it."
msgstr "Das Produkt, um das es im Newsletter-Angebot geht (in der Standardsprache; Übersetzungen werden automatisch gefunden). Die Hinweise im Warenkorb und an der Kasse, die Zeile auf der Produktseite und der automatische Rabatt beziehen sich darauf."

#: includes/settings.php:319
msgid "WooCommerce coupon that is applied automatically to confirmed newsletter subscribers when the Beginner Special is in the cart. It is only valid for confirmed subscribers."
msgstr "WooCommerce-Gutschein, der bestätigten Newsletter-Abonnent:innen automatisch gegeben wird, wenn das Einsteiger-Special im Warenkorb ist. Er gilt nur für bestätigte Abonnent:innen."

#. Notice in the cart and at the checkout when the Beginner Special is in the cart and the e-mail address is not a confirmed subscriber
#: catalogue:newsletter.special_signup_notice
msgid "New here? With a newsletter sign-up the Beginner Special costs only €40 instead of €45 (once per person). Once you have confirmed your sign-up by email, the discount is applied here automatically."
msgstr "Neu bei uns? Mit Newsletter-Anmeldung kostet das Einsteiger-Special nur 40 € statt 45 € (einmalig pro Person). Sobald du deine Anmeldung per E-Mail bestätigt hast, wird der Rabatt hier automatisch angewendet."

#. Notice when the discount code was applied for a confirmed subscriber
#: catalogue:newsletter.special_applied_notice
msgid "Thank you for being part of the newsletter! Your newsletter discount has been applied automatically."
msgstr "Danke, dass du beim Newsletter dabei bist! Dein Newsletter-Rabatt wurde automatisch angewendet."

#. Link to the newsletter sign-up page
#: catalogue:newsletter.signup_button
msgid "Sign up for the newsletter (new tab)"
msgstr "Zur Newsletter-Anmeldung (neuer Tab)"

#. Error when the newsletter code is used by someone who is not a confirmed subscriber
#: catalogue:newsletter.coupon_denied
msgid "This code is only valid for confirmed newsletter subscribers. Please order with the email address you used to sign up."
msgstr "Dieser Code gilt nur für bestätigte Newsletter-Abonnent:innen. Bitte bestelle mit der E-Mail-Adresse, mit der du dich angemeldet hast."

#: includes/settings.php:164
msgid "Credit products in the shop"
msgstr "Guthaben-Produkte im Shop"

#: includes/settings.php:165
msgid "A credit product is a product with a credit amount greater than 0 (product data › General)."
msgstr "Ein Guthaben-Produkt ist ein Produkt mit einem Guthaben-Betrag größer 0 (Produktdaten › Allgemein)."

#: includes/settings.php:168
msgid "Direct checkout"
msgstr "Direkt zur Kasse"

#: includes/settings.php:169
msgid "Complete after payment"
msgstr "Nach Zahlung abschließen"

#: includes/settings.php:287
msgid "Straight to the checkout, replace the cart, quantity 1"
msgstr "Direkt zur Kasse, Warenkorb ersetzen, Menge 1"

#: includes/settings.php:289
msgid "Buying a credit product skips the cart page and replaces whatever was in the cart. Credit products and other products are never mixed in one cart."
msgstr "Beim Kauf eines Guthaben-Produkts entfällt die Warenkorb-Seite, und der bisherige Warenkorb wird ersetzt. Guthaben-Produkte und andere Produkte liegen nie gemeinsam im Warenkorb."

#: includes/settings.php:297
msgid "Complete orders with credit products only once they are paid"
msgstr "Bestellungen, die nur Guthaben-Produkte enthalten, nach der Zahlung abschließen"

#: includes/settings.php:299
msgid "Credits are granted when an order is completed. This way customers get them right after paying. Orders of guests and orders with other products stay as they are."
msgstr "Das Guthaben wird beim Abschluss einer Bestellung gutgeschrieben. So erhalten Kundinnen es direkt nach der Zahlung. Bestellungen von Gästen und Bestellungen mit anderen Produkten bleiben unverändert."

#: includes/credit-checkout.php:192
msgid "Completed automatically: the order consists only of credit products."
msgstr "Automatisch abgeschlossen: Die Bestellung enthält nur Guthaben-Produkte."

